# The town (theme n7, Docs/Design/62-talk.md phase 7): civic grumbles, the Watch and the law, and the last word.
# A grumble remembers what it was about (pair.mem.grumble, for days, so a later grumble can say it's still not mended)
# and its family (conv.gk: mend, levy, law, council, works for the town's doings; rent, dole, past, chapel, young
# for one's own), so the answer fits it. Each answer remembers how it took the grumble (conv.ga: agree, official,
# defend, rich, rebuff, hush, joke, scheme, boast, care, pup, offer), and the grumbler's last word answers that.
# Every reply is the replier's own best rule (a chain's later beats always take their best tier).

## Grumbles about the town (the opener)

rule n7_gr_roads
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore|talk.day
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {gk=mend on=grumble} The road by the well's more hole than road. | {gk=mend on=grumble} Turned my ankle in a rut on the way here. Again. | {gk=mend on=grumble} They mended that road last spring. You'd never know it. | {gk=mend on=grumble} Somebody ought to fill those holes before one swallows a cart. | {gk=mend on=grumble} There's a cobble loose by the corner. It's had three wolves over this week.
remember pair: grumble=roads 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_roads_wet
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.weather|talk.day here.weather=rain|storm here.place=street|market|gate
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {gk=mend on=grumble} There's a puddle at the corner you could drown a calf in. | {gk=mend on=grumble} The street's a river. Look at my boots. | {gk=mend on=grumble} Every rut's a pond. Mind your step, #address#. | {gk=mend on=grumble} Mud to the hocks from my door to here. Who's meant to see to that?
remember pair: grumble=roads 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_drains
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore|talk.day here.region=ridgemere
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {gk=mend on=grumble} Drains are backing up again. You can smell it from the stair. | {gk=mend on=grumble} The gutter on our row's been blocked a week. | {gk=mend on=grumble} Every time it rains, the drains give back what they were given. | {gk=mend on=grumble} Who do you even tell about the drains? I've asked four wolves and got four answers.
remember pair: grumble=drains 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_drains_sump
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day here.region=ridgemere self.quarter=sump
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {gk=mend on=grumble} Water came up through the boards again. Grey water. Not the clean sort. | {gk=mend on=grumble} The Heights' drains all run downhill. Guess where downhill is. | {gk=mend on=grumble} Three days the gutter's been full. The pups sail sticks in it. What can you do?
remember pair: grumble=drains 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_lamps
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day here.time=dusk|night here.region=ridgemere
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {gk=mend on=grumble} Lamp's out on our street again. | {gk=mend on=grumble} Black as a pocket out there. Where's the lamplighter got to? | {gk=mend on=grumble} Walked into a post in the dark. A post! | {gk=mend on=grumble} They light the lamps up the hill first and run out of oil by the time they get to ours.
remember pair: grumble=lamps 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_lamps_town
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day here.time=dusk|night here.region=frosthollow|coldwater|oakhaven|fens|larkfield|southmeadow
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {gk=mend on=grumble} One lamp at the crossroads, and it's out more nights than it's lit. | {gk=mend on=grumble} Walked into the well-head in the dark. The well-head! | {gk=mend on=grumble} You'd think a town with a smithy could keep one lamp burning.
remember pair: grumble=lamps 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_taxes
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.wealth!=rich
does tell.story
cooldown 2d
say {gk=levy on=grumble} Another levy. What for, this time? | {gk=levy on=grumble} They've a new toll on the gate. Pay to come home! | {gk=levy on=grumble} Hearth tax, door tax. They'll tax the smoke next. | {gk=levy on=grumble} Where does it all go, the #money#? Not on our street. | {gk=levy on=grumble} The collector knocked twice. Twice! As if I'd found more since the first time.
remember pair: grumble=taxes 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_taxes_rich
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.wealth=rich
does tell.story
cooldown 2d
say {gk=levy on=grumble} The levy's come again. Do they think it grows on trees? | {gk=levy on=grumble} The assessor came and counted our windows. Counted them! | {gk=levy on=grumble} One does one's share. One does rather more than one's share, frankly.
remember pair: grumble=taxes 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_market_fee
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.work self.role=merchant
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {gk=levy on=grumble} Pitch fee's up again. For the same square of mud. | {gk=levy on=grumble} The market warden moved my stall behind the well. Nobody finds me now. | {gk=levy on=grumble} They want a licence for the awning now. The awning! | {gk=levy on=grumble} Weights inspector's been round twice this month. I've the same weights my father had.
remember pair: grumble=market 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_market_day
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day here.day=market
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {gk=levy on=grumble} Market rules say no carts after the bell. Then how are the goods meant to get in? | {gk=levy on=grumble} The weights inspector came round. Half the stalls packed up quick. | {gk=levy on=grumble} Can't move for stalls on market day, and who sweeps up after? Not them.
remember pair: grumble=market 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_watch
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.role!=guard
does tell.story
cooldown 2d
say {gk=law on=grumble} Never a watchman when you want one. | {gk=law on=grumble} The Watch walks the good streets twice and ours never. | {gk=law on=grumble} Saw two of the Watch dozing on the steps at noon. | {gk=law on=grumble} What do we pay the Watch for, I ask you?
remember pair: grumble=watch 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_watch_crime
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day world.crime=recent self.role!=guard
does tell.self
tone serious
cooldown 1d
say {gk=law on=grumble} Somebody robbed, and the Watch strolls up the next morning. | {gk=law on=grumble} Thieving in the street and the Watch at the inn. | {gk=law on=grumble} They'll catch nobody. They never do. | {gk=law on=grumble} A wolf can't leave a door on the latch any more, and where's the Watch?
remember pair: grumble=watch 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_council
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore here.region=ridgemere
does tell.story
cooldown 2d
say {gk=council on=grumble} The Council's sat a month in the Rain Hall and decided nothing. | {gk=council on=grumble} Four Houses round a table and not one of them's walked our street. | {gk=council on=grumble} The Council's to debate the drains. Again. They've been debating them since my father was a pup.
remember pair: grumble=council 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_rent
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.wealth=poor|destitute self.homeless=no
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {gk=rent on=grumble} Landlord's put the rent up and the roof still leaks. | {gk=rent on=grumble} Rent's due Restday. I've half of it. | {gk=rent on=grumble} They want more for that hole than I paid for my first coat. | {gk=rent on=grumble} The landlord came round to look at the damp. Then he put the rent up for the view.
remember pair: grumble=rent 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_smoke
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.weather here.region=ridgemere self.quarter=works|commons|sump|wharf
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {gk=works on=grumble} The kilns were going all night. My washing's grey. | {gk=works on=grumble} Lime dust on everything. Greatly's dust. | {gk=works on=grumble} You can taste the Tileworks today. Bricks for breakfast. | {gk=works on=grumble} The tannery's on the wind again. I can't get it out of my fur.
remember pair: grumble=smoke 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_noise_works
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day here.region=ridgemere self.quarter=works|wharf|docks
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {gk=works on=grumble} The hammering starts before the gulls. | {gk=works on=grumble} Carts on the cobbles all night. I sleep with my paws over my ears. | {gk=works on=grumble} Foundry bell, wharf bell, chapel bell. You can't hear yourself think.
remember pair: grumble=noise 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_dole
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.on_dole=yes
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {gk=dole on=grumble} The dole loaf's smaller than last month's. I measured. | {gk=dole on=grumble} Two hours in the line and the loaf was yesterday's. | {gk=dole on=grumble} They ask your name, your trade, your mother's trade. For bread.
remember pair: grumble=dole 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_bandit_roads
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.bandits|talk.lore world.bandits=near self.role!=guard
does tell.self
tone serious
cooldown 1d
say {gk=law on=grumble} Bandits on the road and not a soldier sent. | {gk=law on=grumble} We pay for the roads to be kept safe. Who's keeping them? | {gk=law on=grumble} If it was the Houses' wagons being robbed, there'd be riders out by noon.
remember pair: grumble=bandits 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_city_takes
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore here.region=frosthollow|coldwater|oakhaven|fens|larkfield|southmeadow self.from!=ridgemere
does tell.story
cooldown 2d
say {gk=levy on=grumble} The city takes our goods cheap and sends back its prices dear. | {gk=levy on=grumble} Ridgemere this, Ridgemere that. Who ever came up from Ridgemere to mend our bridge? | {gk=levy on=grumble} The levy goes down the road to the city and never comes back up it.
remember pair: grumble=city 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_old_ways
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.stage=old
does tell.memory
cooldown 2d
say {gk=past on=grumble} When I was young the street was swept every Restday. By us. Nobody asked. | {gk=past on=grumble} We had one watchman in the old days and he knew every name. | {gk=past on=grumble} Folk used to mend things themselves. Now they complain about them instead.
remember pair: grumble=oldways 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_chapel_roof
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.piety=devout
does tell.story
cooldown 2d
say {gk=chapel on=grumble} The chapel roof drips on the altar and nobody will pay to mend it. | {gk=chapel on=grumble} Half the town at the festival and a handful at chapel. | {gk=chapel on=grumble} The poor box was light again. Shameful, with what some folk have.
remember pair: grumble=chapel 3d
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_young_rules
when concept=talk.smalltalk self.stage=adolescent
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {gk=young on=grumble} The Watch moved us off the steps. We weren't doing anything! | {gk=young on=grumble} You can't sit anywhere in this town without a grown-up saying move along. | {gk=young on=grumble} They've shut the old yard where we used to play. For a wall.
remember pair: grumble=rules 3d
then other: town.grumble

## A grumble, again (the same two, a day or two on)

rule n7_gr_again_roads
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.mem.grumble=roads
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {gk=mend on=grumble} That hole's still there, you know. Bigger. | {gk=mend on=grumble} Remember the road? A cart lost a wheel in it this morning. Not mine, thank the gods. | {gk=mend on=grumble} Still not mended. I'm going to plant a tree in it.
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_again_lamps
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.mem.grumble=lamps
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {gk=mend on=grumble} Still dark on our street. I've started carrying a candle. | {gk=mend on=grumble} The lamp. Still out. I'd write to someone, if anyone read it. | {gk=mend on=grumble} They lit it! For one night. Then nothing.
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_again_drains
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.mem.grumble=drains
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {gk=mend on=grumble} The drain's no better. Worse, if anything. | {gk=mend on=grumble} I poured lime down ours. Now it smells of lime and the other thing. | {gk=mend on=grumble} Still blocked. Someone's painted a sign on the wall over it: Council's Pond.
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_again_taxes
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.mem.grumble=taxes
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {gk=levy on=grumble} Paid the levy. I've never felt so poor and so respectable. | {gk=levy on=grumble} They came for the levy. I gave them a look and the coin. | {gk=levy on=grumble} That levy we spoke of? It's gone up since.
then other: town.grumble

rule n7_gr_again_rent
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day pair.mem.grumble=rent self.homeless=no
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {gk=rent on=grumble} Paid the rent. Don't ask me how. Don't ask me what I'll eat. | {gk=rent on=grumble} The landlord sent his boy round for the rest. His boy! | {gk=rent on=grumble} Roof's still leaking. I've named the drips.
then other: town.grumble

## Answering a town grumble (self answers; conv.gk says what kind, pair.mem.grumble what about)

rule n7_ga_plain
when concept=town.grumble
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} #agree#. Someone ought to do something. | {ga=agree} Don't get me started. | {ga=agree} Every year the same. | {ga=agree} It's a disgrace, that's what it is.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_shrug
when concept=town.grumble
does react.complaint
say What can you do? | That's the way of it. | Mm. Always something. | Well. There it is.

rule n7_ga_official
when concept=town.grumble self.job=official conv.gk=mend|law|council|works
does react.complaint
say {ga=official} There's a proper way to raise it, you know. A written petition. | {ga=official} The money's voted. It's the spending that's slow. | {ga=official} Leave it with me. No, truly. I'll mention it. | {ga=official} Put it in writing and bring it to the counter. I'll see it goes in the right pile.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_official_levy
when concept=town.grumble self.job=official conv.gk=levy
does react.complaint
say {ga=defend} The levy pays for the lamps, the Watch and the wall. You'd miss them soon enough. | {ga=defend} I only count it. I don't spend it. | {ga=defend} Everyone hates the levy until the wall falls down.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_guard
when concept=town.grumble self.role=guard conv.gk=mend|levy|council|works
does react.complaint
say {ga=official} Take it up with whoever's in charge, not me. I just walk the streets. | {ga=official} We've enough to do keeping the peace. | {ga=official} I'll mention it at the Watch House. They'll laugh, but I'll mention it.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_guard_watch
when concept=town.grumble self.role=guard conv.gk=law pair.mem.grumble=watch
does react.complaint
say {ga=defend} Twelve of us for the whole quarter. You try it. | {ga=defend} I was on my feet fourteen hours yesterday. Dozing on the steps, was I? | {ga=defend} Next time you're robbed, shout for me. See how fast I come.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_guard_bandits
when concept=town.grumble self.role=guard conv.gk=law pair.mem.grumble=bandits
does react.complaint
say {ga=defend} We're to hold the walls, not chase wolves through the hills. Orders. | {ga=defend} Give us horses and we'd ride tonight. They won't give us horses. | {ga=defend} You think I like hearing about it every morning and doing nothing?
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_rich
when concept=town.grumble self.wealth=rich conv.gk=mend|law|works
does react.complaint
say {ga=rich} Have you thought of writing a letter? A firm one. | {ga=rich} Really? Our street's lovely. I hadn't heard. | {ga=rich} How dreadful. Someone really ought to complain. | {ga=rich} I'd no idea. Nobody tells us these things.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_rich_levy
when concept=town.grumble self.wealth=rich conv.gk=levy|council
does react.complaint
say {ga=rich} One pays one's levies and one assumes it's all seen to. | {ga=rich} We pay more than anyone, you know. Not that anyone thanks us. | {ga=rich} Oh, don't. Our accounts go grey every quarter day.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_poor
when concept=town.grumble self.wealth=poor|destitute conv.gk=mend|levy|law|council|works
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} And who pays for it? Us. Always us. | {ga=agree} They'll see to the good streets first and run out of money before they get to ours. | {ga=agree} I'd complain, but they'd charge me for the ink.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_homeless
when concept=town.grumble self.homeless=yes conv.gk=mend|levy|law|council|works|rent
does react.complaint
priority 1
say {ga=shame} At least you've a door to shut on it. | {ga=shame} Try it from a doorway, #address#. | {ga=shame} I'd swap my troubles for yours, and say thank you.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_heights
when concept=town.grumble self.quarter=heights here.region=ridgemere conv.gk=mend
does react.complaint
cooldown 1d
say {ga=rich} Ours was seen to the same morning. I suppose that's not helpful. | {ga=rich} Is it really so bad down there? | {ga=rich} We pay a wolf to see to ours. Perhaps you could... no. No, I see.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_heights_works
when concept=town.grumble self.quarter=heights here.region=ridgemere conv.gk=works
does react.complaint
cooldown 1d
say {ga=rich} We shut the windows when the kilns are lit. Have you tried shutting the windows? | {ga=rich} Is it so very loud down there? We hear a bell, now and then. | {ga=rich} Dreadful for you. Mind, the bricks have to come from somewhere.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_sump_drains
when concept=town.grumble self.quarter=sump pair.mem.grumble=drains other.quarter!=sump
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} Drains? We'd settle for a floor that stays dry. | {ga=agree} Down in the Sump, we are the drain. | {ga=agree} You get a smell. We get the whole river.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_sump
when concept=town.grumble self.quarter=sump here.region=ridgemere other.quarter!=sump conv.gk=mend|works|law
does react.complaint
cooldown 1d
say {ga=rebuff} Come down to the Sump and say that. | {ga=rebuff} That's a good street's trouble, that. | {ga=rebuff} Try a week down our way. You'd come back grateful.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_old
when concept=town.grumble self.stage=old conv.gk=mend|levy|law|council|works
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} I've heard that complaint for sixty years, and I'll hear it for sixty more. | {ga=agree} It was worse when I was a pup. No, it was. Mostly. | {ga=agree} Every lot in charge is the same lot, just younger.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_old_mend
when concept=town.grumble self.stage=old conv.gk=mend
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} In my day we'd have seen to it ourselves and saved the breath. | {ga=agree} We'd a cart of gravel and a Restday afternoon, and that was that. | {ga=agree} It's never been right since they took it off our paws and gave it to the town.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_young_mend
when concept=town.grumble self.stage=young conv.gk=mend
does react.complaint ask.detail
say {ga=pup} Why don't you just mend it yourself? | {ga=pup} I'll help! I've got a spade. A little one. | {ga=pup} Is it very bad? Can I see?
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_young
when concept=town.grumble self.stage=young conv.gk=levy|law|council|works|rent|dole
does react.complaint
say {ga=pup} What does that mean? | {ga=pup} Is that why you're cross? | {ga=pup} When I'm big I'll sort it all out. | {ga=pup} #mum# says that too. Then she sighs.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_dry
when concept=town.grumble self.humour=dry conv.gk=mend|levy|law|council|works
does react.complaint
say {ga=joke} I hear they're forming a committee to look into forming a committee. | {ga=joke} Write them a letter. They love a letter. Keeps the fire going. | {ga=joke} Give it time. Another forty years.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_merry
when concept=town.grumble self.humour=merry conv.gk=mend|levy|law|council|works
does react.complaint
say {ga=joke} Ha! Get it all out now, before they put a levy on moaning. | {ga=joke} I'll drink to the day it's seen to. I'll drink to it now, to be safe. | {ga=joke} Ha. Well, it gives us something to talk about.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_merry_roads
when concept=town.grumble self.humour=merry pair.mem.grumble=roads conv.gk=mend
does react.complaint
say {ga=joke} We could charge a penny a look. See the famous Hole! | {ga=joke} They'll be putting a toll on it next. | {ga=joke} Fill it with ale. I'll see to it personally.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_merry_lamps
when concept=town.grumble self.humour=merry pair.mem.grumble=lamps conv.gk=mend
does react.complaint
say {ga=joke} Look on the bright side. Nothing to steal on a dark street. | {ga=joke} Good for courting, a dark street. Ask anyone. | {ga=joke} Hang a lantern on your tail. I'll follow it home.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_short
when concept=town.grumble self.temper=short conv.gk=mend|levy|law|council|works
does react.complaint
say {ga=rebuff} Then do something about it instead of moaning at me. | {ga=rebuff} I've my own troubles. | {ga=rebuff} Moan, moan. Everyone moans. Nobody does anything.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_nervy
when concept=town.grumble self.temper=nervy conv.gk=levy|law|council
does react.complaint
say {ga=hush} Not so loud. You don't know who's listening. | {ga=hush} Don't. Folk who complain get noticed. | {ga=hush} I'd rather not say anything against anyone, thank you.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_sly
when concept=town.grumble self.honesty=sly conv.gk=mend|levy|law|works
does react.complaint
say {ga=scheme} Things get seen to, if the right paw is crossed. | {ga=scheme} I know a fellow who could see to it. For a small consideration. | {ga=scheme} There's always a way round. You just have to know whose way.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_ambitious
when concept=town.grumble self.drive=ambitious conv.gk=mend|levy|law|works
does react.complaint
say {ga=boast} Somebody should get the street together and go up about it. Somebody like me. | {ga=boast} That's the sort of thing a wolf could make a name fixing. | {ga=boast} If I ran this town, it'd be done by Restday.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_ambitious_council
when concept=town.grumble self.drive=ambitious conv.gk=council
does react.complaint
say {ga=boast} One day there'll be a seat in that hall for someone who's walked our street. | {ga=boast} Four Houses. Why not five? Why not one of us? | {ga=boast} Mark me. I'll be sat in the Rain Hall before I'm grey.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_devout
when concept=town.grumble self.piety=devout conv.gk=mend|levy|law|council|works
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} Pray on it. And complain. Both. | {ga=agree} We bear what we must. But aye, it's a disgrace. | {ga=agree} The Bright One sees it, even if nobody else will.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_merchant_market
when concept=town.grumble self.role=merchant pair.mem.grumble=market conv.gk=levy
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} Fees go up, prices go up. Don't look at me. | {ga=agree} The warden takes his cut and the rain takes the rest. | {ga=agree} We'd all trade from the gutter if they'd let us. A free gutter.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_worker_roads
when concept=town.grumble self.job=laborer|crafter pair.mem.grumble=roads conv.gk=mend
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} I laid half those cobbles. They paid us in promises. | {ga=agree} Give me a cart of stone and a week. I'd have it flat. | {ga=agree} They hire the cheapest gang going and wonder why it sinks.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_carter_roads
when concept=town.grumble self.job=carter pair.mem.grumble=roads conv.gk=mend
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} Lost a wheel on that road. Third this year. | {ga=agree} My horse knows every hole by name. | {ga=agree} You walk it. I drive it, loaded, in the dark.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_incomer
when concept=town.grumble self.from=frosthollow|coldwater|oakhaven|mirebridge|fenshore|larkfield|southmeadow|saltwell here.region=ridgemere conv.gk=mend|works|council
does react.complaint
cooldown 1d
say {ga=agree} In #self.from.capitalize# we'd have seen to it ourselves by now. | {ga=agree} Back home, nobody would stand for it. Well. Nobody would mention it, anyway. | {ga=agree} You should see how we do it in #self.from.capitalize#. Badly, but with less talk.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_townfolk_city
when concept=town.grumble pair.mem.grumble=city conv.gk=levy self.from!=ridgemere
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} Aye, and they call us the backwater. | {ga=agree} Let them come up here and try living off what they leave us. | {ga=agree} The day the city feeds itself, I'll eat my hat.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_quiet
when concept=town.grumble self.talk=quiet
does react.complaint
say Mm. | Aye. | Hm.

rule n7_ga_warm
when concept=town.grumble self.warmth=warm conv.gk=mend|levy|law|council|works|rent
does react.complaint
say {ga=care} Come and sit down. We'll grumble properly over a pot of something. | {ga=care} Oh, you've had a day of it. Here, sit a while. | {ga=care} You're not wrong. Come by later and we'll moan in comfort.
then other: town.close

## Answering one's own troubles: rent, the dole

rule n7_ga_rent_poor
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=rent self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} Ours went up too. Landlords talk to each other. | {ga=agree} Same here. A bit more every quarter, and never a nail spent on the place. | {ga=agree} They know we've nowhere else to go. That's the whole trick.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_rent_rich
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=rent self.wealth=rich|comfortable
does react.complaint
say {ga=offer} Have you tried somewhere cheaper? No. No, I suppose you have. | {ga=offer} Who's your landlord? I might have a word. | {ga=offer} That's too much. Far too much, for what you get.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_rent_short
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=rent|dole self.temper=short
does react.complaint
say {ga=rebuff} Then find work that pays better. | {ga=rebuff} Everyone's short. You're not special. | {ga=rebuff} Moaning won't mend it.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_rent_dry
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=rent self.humour=dry
does react.complaint
say {ga=joke} Rents and rivers. Both rise, and neither asks first. | {ga=joke} Landlords. The only crop that grows in winter. | {ga=joke} Look on the bright side. You've a roof to pay for.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_dole_warm
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=dole self.warmth=warm
does react.complaint
say {ga=offer} Come to ours on Restday. There'll be more than a loaf. | {ga=offer} That's no way to treat folk. Come here. | {ga=offer} I'll save you my heel of bread. Don't argue.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_dole_rich
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=dole self.wealth=rich
does react.complaint
say {ga=rich} We give to the parish every quarter, you know. I'd assumed it went further. | {ga=rich} Smaller? I'll have a word with the chaplain. | {ga=rich} How very trying. Is there truly no work?
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_dole_same
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=dole self.on_dole=yes
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} I was behind you in that line. I saw. | {ga=agree} Yesterday's, and the day before's, by the taste. | {ga=agree} They asked me my grandmother's trade. I made one up.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_dole_devout
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=dole self.piety=devout
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} The Bright One fed the hungry with less. But not much less. | {ga=agree} I'll speak to the chaplain. That's not what the parish loaf is for. | {ga=agree} It's a shame on all of us, a small loaf.
then other: town.close

## Answering the old (the past) and the devout (the chapel)

rule n7_ga_past
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=past
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} Different times. | {ga=agree} Aye, you've said. | {ga=agree} It's a different town now, I suppose.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_past_old
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=past self.stage=old
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} We did. And we moaned about it the whole time. | {ga=agree} Remember the old watchman? Knew every pup by its ears. | {ga=agree} Nobody sweeps now. Nobody knocks. Nobody sits out of an evening.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_past_young
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=past self.stage=young|adolescent
does react.complaint
say {ga=pup} Was it really better? Or were you just younger? | {ga=pup} Everyone old says that. | {ga=pup} What was it like? Tell me about the old days.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_past_dry
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=past self.humour=dry
does react.complaint
say {ga=joke} And the summers were longer, and the pies were bigger. | {ga=joke} Funny how it was always better before I was there to see it. | {ga=joke} Everything was better once. Mostly because we were younger.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_chapel
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=chapel
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} It's a shame, aye. | {ga=agree} I'll put a penny in, Restday. | {ga=agree} Folk are busy. The gods know that.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_chapel_devout
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=chapel self.piety=devout
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} I'll speak to the chaplain. Something must be done. | {ga=agree} We'll pray for full pews. And a full poor box. And a roofer. | {ga=agree} I put in what I can. I'll put in more.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_chapel_ordinary
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=chapel self.piety=ordinary
does react.complaint
say {ga=excuse} I'll come Restday. Probably. | {ga=excuse} I'm there for the festivals. That's something. | {ga=excuse} The gods know where I live. They can call.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_chapel_rich
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=chapel self.wealth=rich
does react.complaint
say {ga=offer} I'll send something round to the chapel. Remind me after Restday. | {ga=offer} One gives what one can. One gave last year, in fact. | {ga=offer} Leave it with me. I'll have a word with the chaplain.
then other: town.close

## Answering the young (moved on by the Watch)

rule n7_ga_teen
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=young
does react.complaint
say {ga=rebuff} There's always somewhere. | {ga=rebuff} Every pup says that. | {ga=rebuff} Go on. You'll live.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_teen_guard
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=young self.role=guard
does react.complaint
say {ga=rebuff} You were blocking the steps, that's what. | {ga=rebuff} Not doing anything's how it starts. | {ga=rebuff} Go and not do anything somewhere else.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_teen_old
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=young self.stage=old
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} In my day we'd have been glad of steps to be moved off. | {ga=agree} You'll have steps enough when you're my age. Getting up them's the trouble. | {ga=agree} They moved us on too. We went and sat on a wall instead.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_teen_young
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=young self.stage=adolescent
does react.complaint
say {ga=agree} They do it to us every day. | {ga=agree} Come to the old boatshed. Nobody comes there. | {ga=agree} I'm sick of it. Sick of grown-ups.
then other: town.close

rule n7_ga_teen_warm
when concept=town.grumble conv.gk=young self.warmth=warm self.stage=adult|old
does react.complaint
say {ga=care} Sit on my step any time. Just don't kick the pots. | {ga=care} I know. It's hard being your age. There's nowhere that's yours. | {ga=care} Come and help me in the yard. I'll pay you in pie.
then other: town.close

## The last word on a grumble (the grumbler; conv.ga says how it was taken)

rule n7_close
when concept=town.close
does ack
say Mm. Well. | #bc_right# | Aye.

rule n7_close_gr_agree
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=agree
does ack
say That's the town. | You're not wrong. | That's what I said. | Glad it's not just me.

rule n7_close_gr_agree_dry
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=agree self.humour=dry
does ack
say I'll hold my breath. | Lovely. I'll tell the hole. | Wonderful. Sleep easy, everyone.

rule n7_close_gr_agree_warm
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=agree self.warmth=warm
does ack
say Ah, it's good to have a moan with you. | Well, at least we've each other to grumble at. | Come by for supper. We'll moan in comfort.

rule n7_close_gr_agree_old
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=agree self.stage=old
does ack
say I'll be in the ground before it's seen to. | Mark my words. | Things were better. Different. Better.

rule n7_close_gr_agree_short
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=agree self.temper=short
does ack
say Useless, the lot of them. | Don't know why I bother. | Hmph. Somebody'll break their neck first.

rule n7_close_gr_official
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=official
does ack
say I'll believe it when I see it. | Mention it loud, then. | A petition. Lovely. That'll fix it. | Right. I'll hold you to that.

rule n7_close_gr_defend
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=defend
does ack
say All right, all right. I didn't mean you. | Hm. Fair enough. | Nobody said it was easy. | I'm only saying what everyone says.

rule n7_close_gr_defend_short
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=defend self.temper=short
does ack
say Then do it better. | Excuses. | Hmph. Somebody's to blame, and it's not me.

rule n7_close_gr_rich
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=rich
does ack
say Must be nice. | Easy for some. | Aye. Well. Not up your way, I suppose. | Quite. #good_day#.

rule n7_close_gr_rich_rich
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=rich self.wealth=rich
does ack
say Quite. One does what one can. | I'll mention it at dinner. | Yes. Someone really ought to.

rule n7_close_gr_rebuff
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=rebuff
does ack
say Only saying. | Suit yourself. | Right. Sorry I spoke. | All right. No need to bite.

rule n7_close_gr_rebuff_short
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=rebuff self.temper=short
does ack
say And a good day to you too. | Bite somebody else, then. | Hmph. Charming.

rule n7_close_gr_excuse
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=excuse
does ack
say See that you do. | Probably. Hm. | I'll save you a seat. Near the door, so you can slip off. | The gods notice who comes, you know.

rule n7_close_gr_shame
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=shame
does ack
say Sorry. I didn't think. | Aye. Fair. You've the worse of it. | Here. It's not much. | I know. I'm sorry.

rule n7_close_gr_hush
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=hush
does ack
say Let them listen. | Sorry. Sorry. You're right. | Who'd bother listening to me? | Fine. I'll moan quietly.

rule n7_close_gr_joke
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=joke
does ack
say Ha. Don't. | You'll laugh when it's you. | Ha! Well. | You're no help at all.

rule n7_close_gr_joke_merry
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=joke self.humour=merry
does ack
say Ha! We should run the place, you and I. | Ha. We'd make a better job of it, anyway. | Ha! I'll stand for the job on a promise of more puddles.

rule n7_close_gr_scheme
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=scheme
does ack
say I'll pass, thanks. | How small a consideration? | I'd sooner put up with it. | I didn't hear that.

rule n7_close_gr_boast
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=boast
does ack
say Go on, then. I'd back you. | You'd be no worse than this lot. | Big talk. | I'll hold you to it.

rule n7_close_gr_care
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=care
does ack
say Go on, then. You're a good sort. | I'd like that. | You always make it better.

rule n7_close_gr_pup
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=pup
does ack
say Never you mind, little one. | Ha. Go on with you. | You'll understand when you're bigger. | Grown-up troubles. Off you go and play.

rule n7_close_gr_offer
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=offer
does ack
say That's kind. Truly. | I'd not ask. But thank you. | You mean that? | I'll not forget it.

rule n7_close_gr_offer_short
when concept=town.close conv.on=grumble conv.ga=offer self.temper=short
does ack
say I'll manage. | I wasn't asking. | Hmph. Thank you. I suppose.

## The last word between neighbours (see town7_neighbours.talk for how the neighbour took it: conv.na)

rule n7_close_nb
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb
does ack
say Right. Good. | We'll say no more about it. | That's settled, then. | Well. Neighbours, eh?

rule n7_close_nb_sorry
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=sorry
does ack
say Good. Well. Neighbours, eh? | No harm done. | Thank you. That's all I wanted. | We'll say no more about it.

rule n7_close_nb_sorry_short
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=sorry self.temper=short
does ack
say See that you do. | Hmph. We'll see. | I'll be listening.

rule n7_close_nb_sorry_warm
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=sorry self.warmth=warm
does ack
say Don't fret. Knock any time. | Ah, I'm glad you're next door, all the same. | It's nothing. Come for supper one night.

rule n7_close_nb_sorry_dry
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=sorry self.humour=dry
does ack
say Lovely. I'll stop drafting the letter. | Peace in our time. | I'll tell the wall.

rule n7_close_nb_rebuff
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=rebuff
does ack
say Charming. | Right. I'll remember that. | Fine. Be like that. | Some neighbour you are.

rule n7_close_nb_rebuff_short
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=rebuff self.temper=short
does ack
say Say that again and I'll knock harder. | You'll want something from me one day. | Hmph. We'll see who's moving.

rule n7_close_nb_rebuff_cold
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=rebuff self.warmth=cold
does ack
say Very well. | Quite. | As you like.

rule n7_close_nb_joke
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=joke
does ack
say Ha. Please don't. | You're impossible. | Ha! Fine. Fine. | I'll stuff my ears with wool.

rule n7_close_nb_dodge
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=dodge
does ack
say It's mine. You know it's mine. | I'll come round for it, then. | Tonight. I mean it. | I'm counting the days.

rule n7_close_nb_give
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=give
does ack
say Thank you. Truly. | You're a good neighbour. | I'll pay it back, Restday. | You've saved my supper.

rule n7_close_nb_give_proud
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=give self.temper=short
does ack
say Thank you. I'll not make a habit of it. | I'll pay you back. Every bit. | Hm. Thank you.

rule n7_close_nb_none
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=none
does ack
say No. Course. I'll try further along. | Fair enough. I know how it is. | Don't fret. We'll manage.

rule n7_close_nb_thanks
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=thanks
does ack
say It's nothing. | Don't mention it. Truly. | What are neighbours for? | You'd do the same.

rule n7_close_nb_thanks_old
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=thanks self.stage=old
does ack
say Your mother would've done the same. | I've had worse neighbours. I've outlived most of them. | You'll do.

rule n7_close_nb_proud
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=proud
does ack
say Course you can. I only offered. | Suit yourself. The offer stands. | All right. It's there if you want it.

rule n7_close_nb_grief
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=grief
does ack
say Knock on the wall. Any hour. | I'll come by tomorrow, then. | You're not on your own. | Eat something. Promise me.

rule n7_close_nb_chat
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=chat
does ack
say Good, good. | Well, I'll let you get on. | Right you are. | Mind how you go.

rule n7_close_nb_glare
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=glare
does ack
say I'm only saying what I've heard. | Hm. We'll see. | Nobody's saying anything. Yet. | Just keep your paws to yourself.

rule n7_close_nb_plead
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=plead
does ack
say All right. All right. I believe you. | Calm down. I'm not the Watch. | I hope that's so. For your sake. | Then you've nothing to worry about.

rule n7_close_nb_promise
when concept=town.close conv.on=nb conv.na=promise
does ack
say Thank you. I'll bring you something back. | You're a treasure. | I'll sleep easier on the road. | Back by Restday, gods willing.
